ersation is translated.How to switchThe game picks your system language the first time you launch it. You can change it any time in Options > Language.About the translationsThese translations were made with AI assistance","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T17:30:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685181","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062950-1846018067933533","game_id":"steam-5062950","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: A Whole New Look, and We're in Steam Next Fest","summary":"Guild of the Tower will be part of Steam Next Fest, October 19 to 26. To get ready, we rebuilt almost every screen in the game. If you tried the demo before, it will look very different now.New interfaceHero Info: all five tabs redesigned. A stat chart with growth projection, equipment slots around your hero with live stat comparison, a full skill tree view, and a relationship web.Gambit editor: each rule is now a row of color-coded chips. Click a chip to change just that part of the rule.Tower ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T14:38:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933533","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062950-1843481262703544","game_id":"steam-5062950","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Party-Based RPG FEST and New Demo Version","summary":"We have updated the demo to a new version in celebration of the Steam Party-Based RPG FEST. We have adjusted the game balance, fixed bugs, and added quality-of-life improvements to the latest demo version.We hope you enjoy the experience. Of course, if you have any further suggestions or encounter any bugs, please feel free to leave a comment.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T04:26:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262703544","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062950-1843481262697603","game_id":"steam-5062950","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: September 12, 2026[","summary":"New Field Notes: Guidebook tab (press ESC). Every lesson the game has ever taught you, collected into 9 chapters and 66 topics you can reread at any time, plus a \"Show me again\" button that replays the original guided tour. New Gambit conditions. You can now require a minimum number of allies to match a condition before a command fires, which finally makes party wide heals and buffs practical. Several buff and shield checks were added as well. Floor map now scrolls vertically, so deeper floors a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T14:53:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262697603","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062950-1840944183785127","game_id":"steam-5062950","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo available now! 10 floors, free","summary":"You never control your heroes directly in combat. Instead you write the rules they follow like FFXII gambit style and watch whether your logic holds. Permadeath, so usually it doesn't hold forever. Around that: recruit heroes with randomly rolled traits, assign them to the forge, alchemy lab, or training grounds, and run a guild across a day cycle where mood, fatigue, and wages all matter. Found a bug or have feedback? Drop it in Discussions already reading and fixing from the first report. Wish","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T04:30:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183785127","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5062950":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:47:17Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:47:16Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5062950":"2026-10-26T16:47:17Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5062950":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:47:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:47:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:47:16Z"},"5063820":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:47:17Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:47:17Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:47:17Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5062950","app_id":5062950,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:22Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"d5903512ee72288e1c406c508460cc7053a7d6e10af5fe8ce9a3b2af0f9f8b4e","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A party-based RPG where you build a guild, program your heroes' battle tactics with the Gambit system, and send them climbing into a mysterious tower where permadeath is real and not everyone comes back down.","publishers":[{"name":"One Wish Studio"}],"developers":[{"name":"One Wish Studio"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793588400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full","is_early_access":true},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Gameplay Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1791393628","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"5062950/147841461/36dc3332e41e792a34cc7c74c9d69bd69cf6b6b6/1791391411